MadVoro Installation Instructions
==================================

Prerequisites
-------------
- CMake >= 3.14
- C++17 compiler (g++, clang++, icpx, etc.)
- Boost >= 1.74.0

Optional:
- MPI implementation (OpenMPI, IntelMPI, MPICH)
- HDF5 >= 1.8.0 with C++ bindings
- VTK >= 9.3.0
- VCL (Vector Class Library)

Build
-----
    git clone https://github.com/maormizrachi/MadVoro.git
    cd MadVoro
    cmake -B build -DMADVORO_WITH_MPI=ON
    cmake --build build -j$(nproc)

Install
-------
    cmake -B build -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/your/install/path -DMADVORO_WITH_MPI=ON
    cmake --build build -j$(nproc)
    cmake --install build

Build & Run Tests
-----------------
    cmake -B build -DMADVORO_BUILD_EXAMPLES=ON -DMADVORO_WITH_MPI=ON
    cmake --build build -j$(nproc)
    cd build && ctest --output-on-failure

All Options
-----------
    -DMADVORO_WITH_MPI=ON/OFF        MPI support (default: OFF)
    -DMADVORO_WITH_HDF5=ON/OFF       HDF5 output support (default: OFF)
    -DMADVORO_WITH_VTK=ON/OFF        VTK visualization (default: OFF)
    -DMADVORO_WITH_VCL=ON/OFF        VCL vectorization (default: OFF)
    -DMADVORO_BUILD_EXAMPLES=ON/OFF  Build examples and tests (default: OFF)
    -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON/OFF       Shared library (default: OFF, static)

See README.md for full details including add_subdirectory() usage.
